  "result": "{\"seen_before\": true, \"matches\": [\"PowerToys#14351\", \"PowerToys#3610\", \"PowerToys#37681\"], \"answer\": \"This feature request has been filed before. It asks for a Listary-style Quick Switch: a hotkey in Open/Save dialogs that jumps to an open Explorer folder or a chosen folder. PowerToys#14351 is the main tracking issue, and other reports (#3610, #37681, #30665) were closed as duplicates of it or of #23. The feature isn't implemented in PowerToys yet. Nothing in the archive gives a timeline. Add your +1 or your Flow Launcher and Lertaro references to #14351 instead of opening a new issue. Until then, use a third-party tool. Listary, Flow Launcher's Dialog Jump, Lertaro, Fluent Search and QuickSwitch all offer this. PowerToys Run's Window Walker (`<`) switches between windows but doesn't change the folder in a dialog.\"}",
